  "id": "positive-correlation",
  "term": "positive correlation",
  "definition": "A positive correlation is a relationship in which higher levels of one factor are linked with higher levels of another. In this context, it means that greater maternal involvement in childcare was associated with greater maternal sensitivity and related measures.",
